      "difficulty": 4,
      "estimated_minutes": 20,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "(a)",
          "steps": [
            "$f_1(h,0)=h(|h|+2)$，故 $f_{1x}(0,0)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\dfrac{h(|h|+2)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(|h|+2)=2$。",
            "$f_1(0,h)=2h(|h|+2)$，故 $f_{1y}(0,0)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\dfrac{2h(|h|+2)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}2(|h|+2)=4$。",
            "两极限均存在，故偏微分可能，$f_{1x}(0,0)=2,\\ f_{1y}(0,0)=4$。"
          ]
        },
        {
